","profile":"Osvaldo Elías Castro Hernández aka Darell Castro aka Darell was born in Puerto Rico on January 5, 1990. His musical career took off after Ñengo Flow's label, Real G4 Life, named him an \"artist to watch\" and he started to work with producers such as Lil Geniuz, Onyx and Symphonic, who helped him develop the lyrics he wrote into full songs. His first hit was called \"Ninguno Se Monta\", a song that made him respected among many artists in the genre, such as Arcangel.\r\n\r\nDarell followed that release with his debut album called \"La Verdadera Vuelta\", in which he mixes rhythms like Trap and Reggaeton. The album produced hits such as \"La Brega\", \"Blanco\", \"No Me Hablen de Calle\" and \"No Le Dices Na\". His most recent single is called \"Tengo Lo Mio\".\r\n\r\nIn addition to his own musical work, Darell has also collaborated with artists such as Tempo, Anuel AA, Farruko and, of course, Ñengo Flow.","provider":"discogs","ref":"discogs:artist:6213756","relations":{"aliases":[{"id":7469611,"name":"Osvaldo Elías Castro Hernández"}],"groups":[{"active":true,"id":7746630,"name":"Darrel Y Berto"}],"members":null,"namevariations":["Darell Castro"]},"schemaVersion":2,"sourceUrl":"https://www.discogs.com/artist/6213756-Darell-2","type":"artist","urls":["https://www.facebook.com/darellpr/","https://www.instagram.com/darellpr/","https://soundcloud.com/darellpr","https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC7i1scMCtNTreXnYs2Sr9Wg","https://twitter.com/darell_rg4l"]}},"/api/discogs/artist/646997/profile":{"cached":true,"profile":{"id":"646997","image":"https://i.discogs.com/KQiRR432hPT-Ra45rYAJTUug4ansdnlNnseliZClBIs/rs:fit/g:sm/q:90/h:600/w:546/czM6Ly9kaXNjb2dz/LWRhdGFiYXNlLWlt/YWdlcy9BLTY0Njk5/Ny0xNTAyOTU0NjA2/LTM4NjEuanBlZw.jpeg","imageThumb":"https://i.discogs.com/VTgJZSN04QSFwwk0-u7H-bloIwp3RPJmP5EgDdRbOx8/rs:fit/g:sm/q:40/h:150/w:150/czM6Ly9kaXNjb2dz/LWRhdGFiYXNlLWlt/YWdlcy9BLTY0Njk5/Ny0xNTAyOTU0NjA2/LTM4NjEuanBlZw.jpeg","profile":"Electronic artist from Brighton, 